}

### 2. Register the same username again (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sudharshan_reddy",
  "name": "Vemuri Jaswanth",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### 3. Login with correct credentials (200)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sudharshan_reddy",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### 4. Login with an unknown username (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "unknownuser",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### 5. Login with a wrong password (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sudharshan_reddy",
  "password": "wrong123"
}

### 6. Register with missing data (400)
